    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Campbells are delighted to have received instructions to bring `Meadow Cottage` to the Open Market.\n\nOccupying a site area of approximately 0.6 Acres, this property comes to the market as an ideal Permanent Residence or Holiday Home.\n\nThe current owners have carried out extensive landscaping works which now showcase the full extent and potential of this generous site. Renovation works have also commenced internally.\n\nAccommodation on the Ground Floor comprises Entrance Porch, Living Room, , Kitchen, Bathroom and No. 3 Bedrooms,\n\nwhile the First Floor provides an an Attic room and office space \n\nExternally, the property benefits from two cabins, one of which is fully wired and fitted with electrical heating, lending itself to a variety of potential uses\n\n\nThe property also boasts spacious garden areas to the front together with a stone chip driveway.\n\nConveniently located within walking distance of a local shop, café and Burtonport Village\n.\n\n\nViewing is by STRICT Appointment Only with Campbells Auctioneers.\n\n\nOur Ref: K1330\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.04m (3'5\") x 1.02m (3'4\")\nTiled\n\nKitchen - 3.95m (13'0\") x 2.09m (6'10\")\nTiled\n\nLiving Room - 3.98m (13'1\") x 2.79m (9'2\")\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.07m (10'1\") x 3.35m (11'0\")\nSolid Fuel Stove\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.68m (8'10\") x 2.14m (7'0\")\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.71m (12'2\") x 3.03m (9'11\")\n\nBathroom - 3.04m (10'0\") x 1.84m (6'0\")\nLaminate Flooring, W.C, Wash Hand Basin, Bathroom\n\nAttic Room - 3.39m (11'1\") x 3.03m (9'11\")\n\nOffice - 3.29m (10'10\") x 3.03m (9'11\")\n\nMain Hallway - 3.97m (13'0\") x 1.32m (4'4\")\nTiled\n\nRear Hallway - 1.61m (5'3\") x 0.81m (2'8\")\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
